function renderMasterPhotos(){if(!isAdmin()||!$('masterPhotosGrid'))return;const mode=$('photoMode')?.value||'Current Tool Photos',q=($('photoSearch')?.value||'').toLowerCase();if($('missingPhotoOnly'))$('missingPhotoOnly').closest('label').classList.toggle('hidden',mode!=='Current Tool Photos');let rows=companyTools().filter(t=>t.status!=='Retired').filter(t=>!q||[t.label,t.name,t.brand,t.categoryName].join(' ').toLowerCase().includes(q));if(mode==='Receipts & Documents'){rows=rows.filter(t=>t.receiptURL);$('masterPhotosGrid').innerHTML=rows.length?rows.map(t=>`<a class="master-photo document-card" href="${esc(t.receiptURL)}" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><div class="document-icon">${icon('folder')}</div><strong>${esc(t.label||'—')} · ${esc(t.name||'Tool')}</strong><span>${esc(t.receiptName||'Receipt / document')}</span></a>`).join(''):'<div class="panel empty" style="grid-column:1/-1"><strong>No receipts or documents yet.</strong><br><span class="small muted">Upload receipts, warranty or service records from the relevant tool. This area is Admin-only.</span></div>';return}const missing=$('missingPhotoOnly')?.checked;rows=rows.filter(t=>!missing||!t.photoURL);$('masterPhotosGrid').innerHTML=rows.length?rows.map(t=>{const hist=state.verificationPhotos.filter(v=>v.assetId===t.id);return`<button class="master-photo" data-photo-history="${t.id}">${t.photoURL?`<img src="${esc(t.photoURL)}" alt="${esc(t.name)}" loading="lazy">`:`<div class="photo-missing">No current photo</div>`}<strong>${esc(t.label||'—')} · ${esc(t.name||'Tool')}</strong><span>Current photo · ${hist.length} visual history record${hist.length===1?'':'s'} ›</span></button>`}).join(''):'<div class="panel empty">No photos match this view.</div>'}
